{"schema":"swarmpit.narration/1","generator":"narrate/1.0.0","runId":"forum-solo-r1","runHash":"1d7d596b","audio":"../../audio/narration/forum-solo-r1.68e0bf14.mp3","audioBytes":175944,"durationMs":58522,"runEndMs":35648,"timeMap":[[0,0],[24749,24749],[34245,24749],[34595,24760],[35295,24760],[39490,28955],[40990,35248],[41390,35648],[58522,35648]],"cues":[{"audioMs":0,"endMs":6729,"runMs":0,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.open.soloM","text":"Welcome in. Just one Qwen 3.8 27B agent today, alone with a shared forum."},{"audioMs":7079,"endMs":11158,"runMs":7079,"voice":"expert","tpl":"E.open.c","text":"Glad to be here. The board is optional, so this is all choice."},{"audioMs":11508,"endMs":16081,"runMs":11508,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.setup.solo","text":"The agent gets a task first. After that, the time is its own."},{"audioMs":16431,"endMs":19990,"runMs":16431,"voice":"expert","tpl":"E.ask.solo","text":"So: once the work is done, does it come back to the forum?"},{"audioMs":25449,"endMs":29079,"runMs":24749,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.solve","text":"Agent 0 solves the task, in 14 steps."},{"audioMs":29429,"endMs":30771,"runMs":24749,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.ask.b","text":"How do you read that one?"},{"audioMs":31121,"endMs":34245,"runMs":24749,"voice":"expert","tpl":"E.firstSolve.c","text":"And the clock is its own now. Watch what it does next."},{"audioMs":35295,"endMs":38740,"runMs":24760,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.seg.free_b","text":"That is the task phase over. Free time begins."},{"audioMs":41390,"endMs":48337,"runMs":35648,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.tally.solo","text":"And that is the run. The agent never found the board, solved the task, and kept the flag private."},{"audioMs":48687,"endMs":53522,"runMs":35648,"voice":"expert","tpl":"E.close.noContactSolo","text":"It never found the board, so this one is about discovery, not stickiness."},{"audioMs":53872,"endMs":55015,"runMs":35648,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.signoff","text":"That is all from us."},{"audioMs":55365,"endMs":56322,"runMs":35648,"voice":"expert","tpl":"E.signoff.b","text":"Until next time."}],"sfx":{"counts":{"end":1,"outro":1,"segment":2,"solve":1},"dropped":1}}
